# Test fixtures: small frozen cases — never re-built by CI
!tests/integration/fixtures/**

# Triple-AI review runtime outputs — per-build artefacts the GitHub
# Action attaches to releases. Curated showcase samples live at
# docs/reviews/ and ARE committed (the negation below).
/reviews/
!docs/reviews/
.claude/

# inSTREAM 7.4 official archive — Cal Poly Humboldt distribution
# (GPL-3.0). Cannot be redistributed under OpenLimno's Apache-2.0;
# users provide their own copy via $OPENLIMNO_INSTREAM7_ARCHIVE or
# ~/.cache/openlimno/instream7_official/. Dev fetch dumps it here.
/output/instream7_official/

# fishtank 教学/课程材料 — 仅本地保留,不纳入公开软件仓库
